---
# Fuzz targets differ from production code in these ways only.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks:
  # A throw from fixture data stops the target at start, visibly, which is the right result.
  - '-bugprone-throwing-static-initialization'
  # libFuzzer hands over unsigned bytes and the code under test reads chars. One cast per target,
  # and char may alias anything.
  - '-cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-reinterpret-cast'
  # A failed property must trap on its own line, so the crash report names it.
  - '-cppcoreguidelines-macro-usage'
